 "note": "Kevin: the owner's own chonky orange-and-white bicolor tabby: ginger back with faint bars, white blaze up the face, white jowls, chest, belly and front socks, ringed tail, half-lidded gold eyes, a teal collar with a sun-gold rune tag. Egg-only, never spawns naturally.",
 "ability_desc": "Paw-fisher: when he sits still next to water he scoops fish out with his paw every 2.5 minutes (every minute at bond 5) and flicks them onto land for you: mostly raw cod and salmon, sometimes a tropical fish, rarely a pufferfish. One catch in four he eats himself (the fish tax). A chonky 40-pound orange cat with 82 clips, 24 of them his own: loafs with his paws crossed (and guards your chests and barrels like that), gives you the judgy stare, does the silly open-mouth face, mlems, sits up like a little person, flops over like a sack of flour, sunbathes belly-up, measures a jump and decides it isn't worth it, gets the hiccups, starts zoomies and runs out of steam, snores, yowls for breakfast at dawn and begs on his hind legs when you hold fish. Petting gets a lean-and-flop, a love bite or a purring melt; pet him too much and he turns grumpy. Creepers get a disapproving stare. His belly jiggles when he walks, lands or flops. Not found in the wild: spawn him with his egg (/mm egg get ArcanaKevin); he arrives already named Kevin and is tamed with raw cod.",
